{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MINE CLICK</strong><br>Mine, upgrade, dominate - every click counts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MINE CLICK</strong> is a fast-paced 3D clicker game for PC that blends action, strategy, and upgrades all set in a dense, mysterious swamp teeming with wild vegetation and apocalyptic atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run through a dangerous marshland filled with valuable rocks and rare resources. Use precise mouse clicks to mine materials, upgrade your abilities, and unlock faster clicking power with even better rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware - you're not alone. Enemy scavengers lurk in the swamp, each carrying their own resources. Challenge them to a click battle - the fastest clicker takes it all. Win, and their loot is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced 3D clicker gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense mining in a dense, post-apocalyptic swamp</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful upgrades for speed, strength, and rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click battles against enemies with valuable resources</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to conquer the swamp - one click at a time?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3860410?t=1753428728","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3860410?t=1753428728","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860410/3a65533bc832d5bbb9dbec83ff3b075f9f95c25f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753428728","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860410/3a65533bc832d5bbb9dbec83ff3b075f9f95c25f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753428728","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],